{"3670460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BlackGate", "steam_appid": 3670460, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.poster.avif?t=1777049119\" width=474 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.webm?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.mp4?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to bring this to Steam Frame.  If we receive enough wishlists we can justify the financial costs to upgrade it to PCVR.<br><br> Inspired by Dead By Daylight and Among Us, <strong>BlackGate</strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer experience where every player has a unique role to play.   Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player with one goal: Survival. 👾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.poster.avif?t=1777049119\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.webm?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.mp4?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an engineer, you and your team are sent to repair <strong>BlackGate</strong> station. Your mission is clear: restore power to the station, unlock crucial systems, and most importantly—stay alive. Each engineer plays a crucial role in the survival of their team. 🛰💥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.poster.avif?t=1777049119\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.webm?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.mp4?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alien begins inside the nest deep within the ship, working its way towards its prey. As the specimen, your goal is simple but deadly. You start in a weak, larval form—but every engineer you harm makes you stronger. 👾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.poster.avif?t=1777049119\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.webm?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.mp4?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you evolve, you unlock new abilities—like heightened senses to detect your prey, or faster movement, and deadly attacks. In your final form, you become an unstoppable force, capable of taking on the engineers head-to-head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.poster.avif?t=1777049119\" width=474 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.webm?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.mp4?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to bring this to Steam Frame.  If we receive enough wishlists we can justify the financial costs to upgrade it to PCVR.<br><br> Inspired by Dead By Daylight and Among Us, <strong>BlackGate</strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer experience where every player has a unique role to play.   Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player with one goal: Survival. 👾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.poster.avif?t=1777049119\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.webm?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.mp4?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an engineer, you and your team are sent to repair <strong>BlackGate</strong> station. Your mission is clear: restore power to the station, unlock crucial systems, and most importantly—stay alive. Each engineer plays a crucial role in the survival of their team. 🛰💥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.poster.avif?t=1777049119\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.webm?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.mp4?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alien begins inside the nest deep within the ship, working its way towards its prey. As the specimen, your goal is simple but deadly. You start in a weak, larval form—but every engineer you harm makes you stronger. 👾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.poster.avif?t=1777049119\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.webm?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.mp4?t=1777049119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you evolve, you unlock new abilities—like heightened senses to detect your prey, or faster movement, and deadly attacks. In your final form, you become an unstoppable force, capable of taking on the engineers head-to-head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Wishlist Now so that we may bring this to Steam. Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player. Inspired by Dead By Daylight, Echo Arena, and Among Us.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“At it's core, BlackGate is great and effectively creates a tense survival horror experience.”<br>UploadVR<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/ab3f94d49f945eb8e7a78758c1ee3d314edaf6c1/header.jpg?t=1777049119", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/9b24e457fff9cbea2791cfd409a7573f881ff24b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777049119", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/9b24e457fff9cbea2791cfd409a7573f881ff24b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777049119", "website": "https://www.funtrainvr.com/blackgate", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 11<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> VR</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> VR</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": " BlackGate™ and all characters, names, and elements are trademarks of and © 2025 Megaverse LLC, a Fun Train® company.<br />\r\n", "developers": ["VRMonkey", "Megaverse LLC"], "publishers": ["Fun Train Inc."], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"i